    "# SWOW-KEC Statistical Treatment Audit\n",
    "\n",
    "**Author:** PCS Meta-Repo Team  \n",
    "**Date:** January 2025  \n",
    "**Version:** 1.0.0  \n",
    "**Repository:** pcs-meta-repo  \n",
    "\n",
    "## Overview\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook provides a comprehensive audit of the statistical treatment of SWOW (Small World of Words) data and its integration with KEC (Knowledge, Entropy, Curvature) metrics. The audit covers:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **KEC Metrics Computation** - Validation of entropy, curvature, and coherence calculations\n",
    "2. **Data Integration Pipeline** - Audit of SWOW-ZuCo merge procedures\n",
    "3. **Statistical Methods** - Review of OLS, MixedLM, and FDR correction procedures\n",
    "4. **Validation Framework** - Assessment of H* criteria and pipeline validation\n",
    "5. **Data Quality Assessment** - Coverage analysis, missing values, and outlier detection\n",
    "\n",
    "## Reproducibility Note\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook consolidates validation procedures that were previously scattered across multiple scripts (`tools/validate_hstar.py`, `tools/pipeline_v43.py`, etc.) to maximize reproducibility and transparency."
   ]
  },
